ze conversion are confirmed for the order. Outsole, midsole and insole compositions are not specified. Send your color-size quantities, destination, packing requirements and requested dispatch date for an order-specific quotation. Availability and supply terms are confirmed during inquiry; no ready-stock or performance guarantee is made.</value></field><field id="companyDesc" type="input"><value>Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear &amp; Apparel Co., Ltd. supports footwear wholesale inquiries. The company capability images below describe general business capabilities. Product-specific supply, samples, customization, packing and dispatch are assessed against your order requirements before quotation.</value></field><field id="companyFaqDesc" type="multiComplex"><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>What materials are specified?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>The upper is cow suede and the lining is PU. Outsole, midsole and insole compositions are not specified. Send any additional material requirements with your inquiry so they can be checked before ordering.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>Which colors and sizes can I request?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>Listed colors are Black, Green and Beige, with size labels 39-46. Provide a quantity for each requested color and size. Measurements, fit and any international size conversion are confirmed for your order.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>What construction is visible in the photos?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>The actual photos show a slip-on opening, plain central vamp, stitched U-shaped vamp panel, perforated surrounding panels and closed heel. Review the pictured shape for your intended business casual assortment.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>What are the minimum and quantity prices?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>The listing minimum is 2 pairs. Indicative unit prices are USD 19.04 for 2-49 pairs, USD 17.77 for 50-99 pairs and USD 16.50 for 100 or more pairs. Final quotation depends on color-size mix, packing, destination and agreed order terms; freight and any taxes are confirmed separately.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>Can I request samples or customization?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>Send your sample quantity or customization requirements with the color-size mix. Feasibility, sample charges, logo or packing options and applicable minimums are assessed before quotation.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>Is stock or a dispatch date guaranteed?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>No ready-stock or fixed dispatch promise is made. Provide total quantity, destination, packing requirements and requested dispatch date. Supply, per-size availability, payment terms and the dispatch arrangement are confirmed for your inquiry.</value></field></complex-values></field></itemSchema>